// vcp/bfem/constants/dict/registry_3d.hpp
//
// CONST-B2a + CONST-B2bp: generated 3D class registry (dictionary first
// layer).  First generated by sandbox/probes/constb2a_registry_gen.cpp;
// regenerated in full by sandbox/probes/constb2bp_aggregate.cpp
// from the 4-machine + creator results (gate G-R6 checks that a
// re-aggregation agrees bit for bit).  Do not edit by hand.
//
// Entry semantics: Chat^2 := C_d(K_rep)^2 / h^2(K_rep) as a
// 12-significant-digit UPWARD decimal string; consumption is
// C_d(K)^2 <= Chat^2 * h^2(K).  Keys are the canonical similarity
// keys of dict_entry.hpp as integer fractions.  rep-vertices are
// the integer-rescaled representatives.  Diagnostic components
// (mu, ch2) of every entry are recorded in the per-entry log-ref
// result file, not here.
//
// Lexical regime B: decimal strings are authorized INSIDE the
// marker block only (cm1_ch_tests G7).

